       "html": "<!-- LEDAJANS SEO - Sayfa Üstü Hero/Banner - P1.25 COB LED Ekran -->\n<style>\n.ledajans-blog-hero{\n  position:relative;height:220px;\n  background-image:url('https://ledajans.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Firefly_Gemini-Flash_LEDAJANS-sirketi-led-tabelalar-uretip-satip-montajini-yapiyor-harika-calisiyorlar-ve-535525-scaled.png');\n  background-size:cover;background-position:center;background-repeat:no-repeat;\n}\n@media (min-width:640px){.ledajans-blog-hero{height:260px;}}\n@media (min-width:768px){.ledajans-blog-hero{height:320px;}}\n.ledajans-blog-hero-overlay{\n  position:absolute;inset:0;\n  background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(26,26,46,.88),rgba(22,33,62,.82));\n}\n.ledajans-blog-hero-inner{\n  position:relative;height:100%;max-width:80rem;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1rem;\n  display:flex;align-items:center;\n}\n@media (min-width:640px){.ledajans-blog-hero-inner{padding:0 1.5rem;}}\n@media (min-width:1024px){.ledajans-blog-hero-inner{padding:0 2rem;}}\n.ledajans-blog-hero-title{\n  margin:0;color:#fff;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.2;\n  font-size:2rem;\n}\n@media (min-width:640px){.ledajans-blog-hero-title{font-size:2.5rem;}}\n@media (min-width:768px){.ledajans-blog-hero-title{font-size:3rem;}}\n.ledajans-blog-hero-subtitle{\n  display:block;margin-top:.5rem;color:#f46f2c;line-height:1.5;\n  font-size:.9rem;\n}\n@media (min-width:640px){.ledajans-blog-hero-subtitle{font-size:1rem;}}\n@media (min-width:768px){.ledajans-blog-hero-subtitle{font-size:1.1rem;}}\n</style>\n<div class=\"ledajans-blog-hero\">\n<div class=\"ledajans-blog-hero-overlay\"></div>\n<div class=\"ledajans-blog-hero-inner\">\n<div>\n<h1 class=\"ledajans-blog-hero-title\">P1.25 COB LED Ekran</h1>\n<span class=\"ledajans-blog-hero-subtitle\">1.25mm piksel aralığı, CFA125 model yapısı ve ≥3840Hz yenileme hızı ile kurumsal iç mekan projelerinde net ve dengeli görüntü.</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
